198
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:33,870
- [Narrator] Pyka was founded in 2017 by four entrepreneurs

199
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:36,780
with a vision to bring society a safer, cleaner,

200
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:39,300
and more cost-effective form of transportation

201
00:09:39,300 --> 00:09:41,970
enabled by autonomous electric aircraft.

202
00:09:41,970 --> 00:09:44,010
But to get there, we have taken a very different

203
00:09:44,010 --> 00:09:45,780
approach than most.

204
00:09:45,780 --> 00:09:47,550
First, we gave up on the vertical takeoff

205
00:09:47,550 --> 00:09:50,907
and landing requirements of past aircraft we have developed

206
00:09:50,907 --> 00:09:52,350
in order to dramatically simplify our products

207
00:09:52,350 --> 00:09:54,210
and increase their range.

208
00:09:54,210 --> 00:09:56,176
And second, we wanted to bring

209
00:09:56,176 --> 00:09:57,009
an autonomous electric aircraft to market

210
00:09:57,009 --> 00:09:58,713
as fast as humanly possible.

211
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:02,130
So we targeted use cases that have an inherent tolerance

212
00:10:02,130 --> 00:10:04,593
of risk and an immediate need for innovation.

213
00:10:05,490 --> 00:10:08,040
We started with the most dangerous commercial aviation

214
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,530
mission on Earth, which is crop dusting.

215
00:10:10,530 --> 00:10:11,970
And then the question for us was,

216
00:10:11,970 --> 00:10:14,130
can we actually show an end-to-end proof

217
00:10:14,130 --> 00:10:16,080
of these autonomous electric capabilities

218
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:19,050
really demonstrate their significance to customers?

219
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:20,943
So that is exactly what we did.

220
00:10:21,810 --> 00:10:23,850
We identified the requirements for the market

221
00:10:23,850 --> 00:10:26,250
and designed an extremely innovative product

222
00:10:26,250 --> 00:10:28,980
to fit those requirements that incorporates just dozens

223
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:32,010
of proprietary technologies ranging from batteries

224
00:10:32,010 --> 00:10:33,780
to motor controllers to motors,

225
00:10:33,780 --> 00:10:36,010
and the entire flight control stack

226
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:36,990
in avionics underneath that.

227
00:10:36,990 --> 00:10:39,360
We then secured precedent setting regulatory approvals

228
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,710
for the aircraft, which allows us

229
00:10:40,710 --> 00:10:43,020
to operate commercially in the United States,

230
00:10:43,020 --> 00:10:45,660
in Brazil and much of Latin America.

231
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:47,760
We delivered to some of the biggest players in the market,

232
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,440
including Dole and Embraer.

233
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:52,110
And ramped production to roughly one aircraft per month

234
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:54,303
while racking up over 5,000 flights.

235
00:10:55,410 --> 00:10:58,075
On top of that, we answered the market's demand

236
00:10:58,075 --> 00:10:59,760
for a large scale zero emission cargo aircraft

237
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:03,303
by launching an exciting new product, Pelican Cargo.

238
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:06,810
Today we've delivered Pelican Cargo to customers

239
00:11:06,810 --> 00:11:09,480
including the United States Air Force Research Lab

240
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,520
as well as Skyports' drone services.

241
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,230
And we managed to pull all of this off

242
00:11:13,230 --> 00:11:14,780
with roughly $30 million spent.

243
00:11:16,050 --> 00:11:18,300
With five years of commercial operation under our belt

244
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,280
and customers across three different continents,

245
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:23,520
Pyka is by far the leader in commercializing large scale

246
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,970
autonomous electric aircraft.

247
00:11:26,610 --> 00:11:28,950
We're now rapidly scaling up production in the Bay Area

248
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:31,170
with an eye towards significant revenue growth

249
00:11:31,170 --> 00:11:32,640
in the next couple of years

250
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:34,640
as well as a fast path to profitability.

251
00:11:37,955 --> 00:11:41,160
(attendees applaud)

252
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:44,010
- I'm still going. (laughs)

253
00:11:44,010 --> 00:11:48,150
