265
00:12:21,570 --> 00:12:23,820
and we are actively flying our aircraft

266
00:12:23,820 --> 00:12:25,353
there every single day.

267
00:12:26,850 --> 00:12:29,340
Our founders really wanted our products

268
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:33,210
to actually make a real world impact quickly.

269
