00:12:37,170 --> 00:12:40,800
and where our aircraft would have an immediate benefit

271
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,510
to our customers.

272
00:12:42,510 --> 00:12:44,820
We started with crop dusting,

273
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:48,540
which is the most dangerous flight mission on Earth.

274
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:50,280
Just to give you a bit of a sense of this,

275
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:53,820
a pilot who has a 40 plus year career

276
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:58,443
as a crop duster has about a 15% chance of dying on the job.

277
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:02,520
We launched our agricultural aircraft as a safer,

278
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:04,620
cleaner and more cost-effective alternative

279
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:07,530
to the conventional crop dusting methods.

280
00:13:07,530 --> 00:13:10,350
One, there's no pilot on board.

281
00:13:10,350 --> 00:13:12,330
There is, it's zero emission.

282
00:13:12,330 --> 00:13:15,720
It massively reduces the drift of the chemicals

283
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,550
that are spraying that can be really harmful

284
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:20,310
to neighboring communities and neighboring farms.

285
00:13:20,310 --> 00:13:24,270
And it reduces the use of these chemicals up to 15%,

286
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:27,150
which in addition to being more environmentally friendly

287
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:29,943
is also creates significant cost savings.

288
00:13:31,110 --> 00:13:33,960
In 2021, we then launched our Pelican Cargo,

289
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:36,180
which is the aircraft on the left.

290
00:13:36,180 --> 00:13:39,468
It has about 80% shared commonality

291
00:13:39,468 --> 00:13:41,162
with our agricultural aircraft.

292
00:13:41,162 --> 00:13:43,380
So we reused a lot of the same design choices

293
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:46,473
and then made modifications to support the new use cases.

294
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:50,850
We created this product as a zero emission commercial

295
00:13:50,850 --> 00:13:54,360
logistics platform designed to enable deliveries

296
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,820
of critical supplies to remote, rural

297
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:59,670
and hard to get to locations.

298
00:13:59,670 --> 00:14:02,520
We're now actually expanding the capabilities

299
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:04,290
of our cargo aircraft

300
00:14:04,290 --> 00:14:07,510
to support humanitarian disaster relief

301
00:14:08,585 --> 00:14:10,085
and defense use cases as well.

302
00:14:11,043 --> 00:14:13,260
We're actually excited to be launching the next generation

303
00:14:13,260 --> 00:14:15,540
of Pelican Cargo soon.

304
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:19,083
So stay tuned for the launch of this aircraft.

305
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,830
On the regulatory side,

306
00:14:22,830 --> 00:14:25,860
we've achieved industry first milestones.

307
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:30,090
Pyka today is the largest autonomous aircraft authorized

308
00:14:30,090 --> 00:14:33,900
by the FAA for commercial use in the United States.

309
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:36,270
