1696
01:17:07,890 --> 01:17:10,080
So it's honestly very, very exciting.

1697
01:17:10,080 --> 01:17:11,250
And now is the time that we're trying

1698
01:17:11,250 --> 01:17:12,990
to build that pipeline.

1699
